# =============================================================================
# Raw corpora are NOT versioned: 6.1 GB, and every byte is re-downloadable.
#   research/scripts/download_data.py          HF parquet datasets
#   research/scripts/fetch_missing_shards.py   remaining shards (via hf-mirror)
#   research/scripts/xscaffold_download.py     cross-scaffold corpora
#   research/scripts/fetch_gold_patches.py     independent gold patches
#
# What IS versioned: research/data/processed (283 MB) and research/data/annotations,
# so that the five verification gates run immediately after a clone.
# =============================================================================
research/data/raw/
research/data/cache/
research/_cache/

# Python caches and bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# LaTeX intermediates (main.pdf and main.bbl are kept)
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.blg
paper/*.synctex.gz

# Local secrets — never commit these
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
